  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You always have @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMoonbeam00]{Moonbeam} prepared. When you cast it, you can modify it so that you glow faintly while the spell is active, shedding Dim Light out to 5 feet; whenever a creature fails its saving throw against this Moonbeam, another creature of your choice you can see within 60 feet of you regains 2d4 Hit Points. Once you modify Moonbeam this way, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
